# Galaxy Book 10.6: the charger must not wake the tablet from sleep. Its
# "online" state was seen dropping out every 11 seconds for an hour on the
# SM-W627 (2026-11-10); as a wake-up source every such change would end the
# sleep of a closed tablet. Power button and cover still wake it.
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", ATTR{type}=="Mains", ATTR{power/wakeup}="disabled"
